{"id":"W285c929af3acf7c3d5f699b5","zh":"动力演化","en":"","name":"动力演化","language":"zh","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","concept_id":"C9424a78fd13bc783c5d2","families":[],"definition_zh":"文中动力响应或结构状态随运行和损伤积累发生的变化。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W285c929af3acf7c3d5f699b5","text":"动力演化","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sb0bb05272884270c6c60","source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"高速铁路无砟轨道结构中的轨道板、自密实混凝土填充层和底座板等属混凝土类材料, 砂浆层为黏弹性材料,开展无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化研究,涉及系统不同材料疲劳损伤本构、系统动力状态空间耦合和时域演化等层面的综合研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S1da693d6db11d0568955","source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于铁路列车-轨道-基础结构系统统一分析模型,引入无砟轨道混凝土类、黏弹性类材料的疲劳损伤本构关系,建立列车循环作用下无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化计算模型,较为系统地开展无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W7941d7d8acc981a445076666","name":"dynamic evolution","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W7941d7d8acc981a445076666","name":"dynamic evolution","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W7941d7d8acc981a445076666","name":"dynamic evolution","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P123","title